graph TD
    subgraph Host_Container ["Host Shell: shell-app (Port 3000)"]
        Nav["Global Navigation & Header"]
        Redux["Global Auth State (JWT)"]
        Router["React Router DOM 7"]
    end

    subgraph Product_Remote ["mfe-product (Port 3001)"]
        Catalog["ProductCatalog Component"]
        Detail["ProductDetail Component"]
        Filter["Category & Price Filters"]
    end

    subgraph Order_Remote ["mfe-order (Port 3002)"]
        Cart["CartDrawer Component"]
        Checkout["CheckoutModal Component"]
        History["OrderHistory Component"]
    end

    subgraph User_Remote ["mfe-user (Port 3003)"]
        Auth["AuthModal (Login / Register)"]
        Profile["UserProfile Component"]
        Address["AddressManager Component"]
    end

    Host_Container -->|Dynamic Import remoteEntry.js| Product_Remote
    Host_Container -->|Dynamic Import remoteEntry.js| Order_Remote
    Host_Container -->|Dynamic Import remoteEntry.js| User_Remote

    Product_Remote -.->|Window CustomEvent ucp:cart:add| Order_Remote
    User_Remote -.->|Dispatches Auth Token to Redux| Host_Container
